hadiths[130]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5362","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui thin aur aap se aik khaadim maanga tha, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tumhen aik aisi cheez na bata dun jo tumharey liye us se behtar ho. sotey waqt tentis ( 33 ( martaba ( sub'haanallaah ( , Mina tentis ( 33 ( martaba ( alhamdulillah (aur chauntis ( 34 ( martaba ( Allahu-akbar ( padh liya karo. Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne kaha ke unmein se aik kalima chauntis baar keh ley. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir maine un kalimon ko kabhi nahi chhoda . unse puchha gaya jange-siffain ki raaton mein bhi nahi? kaha ke safain ki raaton mein bhi nahi."
"5363","ghar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya kya kartey they? Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar ke kaam kya kartey they, phir aap jab azan ki awaz suntey to bahar chaley jatey they."
"5364","Hind binte- Utba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Abu-Sufiyan (unke shauhar) kanjoos hain aur mujhey itna nahi detey jo mere aur mere bachchon ke liye kafi ho sakey. haan agar main unki laa-ilmii mein unke maal mein se ley loon (to kaam chalta hai). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum dastoor ke muwafiq itna ley sakti ho jo tumharey aur tumharey bachchon ke liye kafi ho sakey."
"5365","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke oont par Sawar honey wali aurton mein (yani Arab ki aurton mein) behtreen auratein qureshi auratein hain. doosrey rawi ( ibne- Taaus ( ne bayan kya ke Quraish ki Saleh , nek auratein ( sirf lafz qureshi aurton ke bajaey) bachchey par bachpan mein sabse zyada meharban aur apne shauhar ke maal ki sabse zyada hifazat karne waaliyaan hoti hain. Muawiya aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisi hi riwayat ki hai."
"5366","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey mera kapdey ka joda hadiye mein diya to maine usey khud pahan liya, phir maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra Mubarak par narazgi dekhi to maine usey phaad kar apni aurton mein taqseem kar diya."
"5367","mere walid Shahid ho gaey aur unhon-ne saat (7) ladkiyan chhodiin ya (raawii ne kaha ke) nau (9) ladkiyaan. chunanche maine aik pahley ki shadi shuda aurat se nikah kya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya ke Jaabir! tum ne shadi ki hai? maine kaha ji haan. farmaya, kunwari se ya biyaahii se. maine arz kya ke biyaahii se. farmaya tum ne kisi kunwari ladki se shadi kyon na ki. tum iske sath kheltey aur wo tumharey sath kheltii. tum iske sath hansii-mazaaq kartey aur wo tumharey sath hansi karti. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke Abdullah ( mere walid ( Shahid ho gaey aur unhon-ne kai ladkiyan chhodi hain, isliye maine ye pasand nahi kya ke unke paas un hi jaisi ladki biyaah laaun, isliye maine aik aisi aurat se shadi ki hai jo unki dekh bhaal kar sakey aur unki islaah ka khayal rakhey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke Allah tumhen barkat de ya (raawii ko shak tha) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( kheeraa . Mina ( farmaya yani Allah tum ko khair ata kare."
"5368","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik sahib aaey aur kaha ke main to halaak ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aakhir kya baat huii? unhon-ne kaha ke maine apni biwi se Ramazan mein ham-bistarii kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aik ghulam aazad kar do. (ye kaffara ho jaaeyga) unhon-ne arz kya ke mere paas kuchh nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir 2 mahiney lagaataar rozey rakh lo. unhon-ne kaha ke mujh mein uski bhi taqat nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir sath miskinon ko khana khilaao. unhon-ne kaha ke itna bhi mere paas nahi hai. iske baad aap ke paas aik tokraa laya gaya jis mein khajoorein thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke masla poochhney wala kahan hai? un sahib ne arz kya main yahan hazir hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke lo usey (apni taraf se) sadqa kar dena. unhon-ne kaha apne se zyada zarurat mand par? ya Rasulullah! us zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath bheja hai, un donon pathreeley maidaanon ke darmyan koi gharaana ham se zyada mohtaaj nahi hai. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansey aur aap ke Mubarak daant dikhai dene lagey aur farmaya, phir tum hi uske zyada mustahiq ho."
"5369","Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya mujhey abu-Salma (unke pahley shauhar) ke ladkon ke barey mein sawab milega agar main un par kharch karun. main unhein us mohtaajii mein dekh nahi saktii, wo mere betey hi to hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, tumhen har us cheez ka sawab milega jo tum un par kharch karogii."
"5370","Hind ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Abu-Sufiyan kanjoos hain. agar main unke maal se itna ( unse poochhey baghair) ley liya karun jo mere aur mere bachchon ko kafi ho to kya usmein koi gunah hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dastoor ke mutabiq ley liya karo."
"5371","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jab kisi aisey shakhs ka janaaza laya jata jis par qarz hota to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) malum farmatey ke marney waley ne qarz ki adaaeygi ke liye tarka chhoda hai ya nahi. agar kaha jata ke itna chhoda hai jis se unka qarz ada ho sakta hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki Namaz padhtey, warna musalmanon se kehtey ke apne sathi par tum hi Namaz padh lo. phir jab Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par futoohaat ke darwazey khol diye to farmaya ke main musalmanon se unki khud apni zaat se bhi zyada qareeb hun isliye un musalmanon mein jo koi wafat paaey aur qarz chhodey to uski adaaeygi ki zimme-dari meri hai aur jo koi maal chhodey wo uske waarison ka hai."
"5372","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri behan (aza binte- abi Sufiyaan) binte- abii-Sufiyaan se nikah kar lijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur tum usey pasand bhi karogii (ke tumhari behan tumhari saukan bin jaaey)? maine arz kya ji haan, us se khali to main ab bhi nahi hun aur main pasand karti hun ke apni behan ko bhi bhalai main apne sath Sharik kar loon. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke ye mere liye jaaiz nahi hai. (2 bahnon ko aik sath nikah mein jama karnaa) maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qism is tarah ki baatein ho rahi hain ke aap darra binte- abi Salma se nikah ka irada rakhtey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Umme-Salma ki betii. jab maine arz kya, ji haan to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo meri parwarish mein na hoti jab bhi wo mere liye halal nahi thi wo to mere doodh Sharik bhai ki ladki hai. mujhey aur abu-Salma ko Sobiya ne doodh pilaya tha. isliye tum mere liye apni ladkiyon aur bahnon ko na pesh kya karo aur Shuaib ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne aur unse Urwa ne, kaha ke Sobiya ko abu-Lahab ne aazad kya tha."
"5373","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bhookey ko khilaao-pulaao, bimar ki mizaaj pursi karo aur qaidi ko chhudaao. Sufiyan Sory ne kaha ke (hadees mein) lafz ( عاني ( se murad qaidi hai."
"5374","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat tak aal Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par kabhi aisa zamana nahi guzra ke kuchh din barabar unhon-ne pet bhar ke khana khaya ho aur isi sanad se."
"5375","unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( bayan kya ke faaqe ki wjah se) mein sakht mashaqqat mein mubtala tha, phir meri mulaqat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se hui aur unse maine Quran Majeed ki aik aayat padhney ke liye kaha, unhon-ne mujhey wo aayat padh kar sunai aur phir apne ghar mein dakhil ho gaey. iske baad main bahut door tak chalta raha. aakhir mashaqqat aur bhook ki wjah se main munh ke bal gir padaa . achcha maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere sar ke paas khadey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Abu-Hurera ! maine kaha hazir hun, ya Rasulullah ! taiyaar hun. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera hath pakad kar mujhey khada kya. aap samajh gaey ke main kis takleef mein mubtala hun. phir aap mujhey apne ghar le gaey aur mere liye doodh ka aik bada piyala mangwaayaa. maine usmein doodh piyaa . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dobara piyo ( Abu-Hurera ! ( maine dobara piyaa . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur piyo . maine aur piyaa . yahan tak ke mera pet bhi piyaale ki tarah bharpur ho gaya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) se mila aur unse apna Sara waqia bayan kya aur kaha ke aey umr ! Allah Taala ne usey us zaat ke zariey pura kara diya, jo aap se zyada mustahiq thi. Allah ki qism ! maine tum se aayat poochhi thi halanke main usey tum se bhi zyada behtar tareeqe par padh sakta tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! agar maine tum ko apne ghar mein dakhil kar liya hota aur tum ko khana khilaa deta to laal laal (umda ( oont milney se bhi zyada mujh ko khushi hoti."
"5376","main bachcha tha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki parwarish mein tha aur (khaatey waqt) mera hath bartan mein charon taraf ghoomaa karta. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke betey ! bismillaah padh liya karo, daahiney hath se khaya karo aur bartan mein wahan se khaya karo jo jagah tujh se nazdeek ho. chunanche iske baad mein hamesha usi hidayat ke mutabiq khata raha."
"5377","aik din maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khana khaya aur bartan ke charon taraf se khaney laga to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke apne nazdeek se khaa."
"5378","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein khana laya gaya, aap ke sath aap ke rabeeb (parwarish mein rahnewaalaa) Umar-bin-abii-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bismillaah padh aur apne samney se khaa."
"5379","aik darzii ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khaney ki dawat ki jo unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye taiyaar kya tha. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath mein bhi gaya, maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) piyaale mein charon taraf kadu talash kartey they (khaaney ke liye) bayan kya ke isi din se kadu mujh ko bhi bahut bhaaney laga."
"5380","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jahan tak mumkin hota paakii hasil karne mein, jootaa pahnney aur kangha karne mein dahini taraf se shuruaat kartey. Ashas us hadis ka rawi jab waasit Shahar mein tha to usne us hadis mein yun kaha tha ke har aik kaam main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dahini taraf se shuruaat kartey."
"5381","abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki awaz mein zauf w naqahat ko mehsus kya hai aur malum hota hai ke aap faaqe se hain. kya tumharey paas koi cheez hai? chunanche unhon-ne jau ki chand rotiyaan nikaaliin, phir apna dupatta nikala aur uske aik hisse mein rotiyon ko lapet kar mere (yani Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke) kapdey ke nichey chipa diya aur aik hissey mujhey chadar ki tarah odha diya, phir mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. bayan kya ke main jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aapko masjid mein paya aur aap ke sath sahaba they. main un sab hazraat ke samney ja kar khada ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke aey Anas! tumhen abu-Talha ne bheja hoga. maine kaha ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : khaney ke saath? maine arz ki, ji haan. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sathiyon se farmaya ke khadey ho jao . chunanche aap rawaana huey. mein sab ke aagey-aagey chalta raha. jab abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas wapas pahuncha to unhon-ne kaha : Umme-Sulaim! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba ko sath lekar tashrif laey hain, halanke hamarey paas khaney ka itna saman nahi jo sab ko kafi ho sakey. Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) is par boliin ke Allah aur uska rasool khub jantey hain. bayan kya ke phir abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) (istiqbaal ke liye) nikley aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mulaqat ki. iske baad abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur ghar mein dakhil ho gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme-Sulaim ! jo kuchh tumharey paas hai wo yahan laao. Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) roti laaein , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur uska chooraa kar liya gaya. Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne ghi ke dabbe mein se ghi nichod kar uska maleeda bana liya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki jo kuchh Allah Taala ne aap se dua karaanii chaahii, iske baad farmaya ke un das das aadmiyon ko khaney ke liye bula lo. chunanche das sahaba ko bulaya. sab ne khaya aur pet bhar kar bahar chaley gaey. phir farmaya ke das ko aur bula lo, unhein bulaya gaya aur sab ne pet bhar kar khaya aur bahar chaley gaey. phir aap ne farmaya ke das sahaba ko aur bula lo, phir das sahaba ko bulaya gaya aur un logon ne bhi khub pet bhar kar khaya aur bahar tashrif ley gaey. iske baad phir das sahaba ko bulaya gaya is tarah tamam sahaba ne pet bhar kar khaayaa, us waqt usi ( 80 ( sahaba ki jamat wahan maujood thi."
"5382","ham aik so tees aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tum mein se kisi ke paas khana hai. aik sahib ne apne paas se aik saa ke qareeb aata nikaalaa, usey goondh liya gaya, phir aik mushrik lambaa-tadangaa apni bakriyan haanktaa hua udhar aa gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se malum farmaya ke ye bechney ki hain ya Atiya hain ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (atiya ke bajaey) hiba farmaya, us shakhs ne kaha ke nahi balke bechney ki hain. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se aik bakri kharidi phir zabah ki gaee aur aap ne uski kalejii bhooney janey ka hukm diya aur qism Allah ki aik so tees logon ki jamat mein koi shakhs aisa nahi raha jisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us bakri ki kalejii ka eik-eik tukda kaat kar na diya ho magar wo maujood tha to usey wahin de diya aur agar wo maujood nahi tha to uska hissey mehfooz rakhaa, phir us bakri ke gosht ko pakka kar do badey koondon mein rakha aur ham sab ne unmein se pet bhar kar khaya phir bhi donon koondon mein khana bach gaya to maine usey oont par laad liya. Abdur-Rehman rawi ne aisa hi koi kalima kahaa."
"5383","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui, un dinon ham pani aur khajoor se sair ho janey lagey they."
"5384","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar ki taraf ( 7 hijri mein) nikley jab ham maqam Sahbaa par pahunchey . Yahya ne bayan kya ke Sahbaa khaibar se do-pahar ki raah par hai to us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khana talab farmaya lekin sattu ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi laai gaee, phir ham ne usi ko sookhaa phaank liya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani talab farmaya aur kulli ki, ham ne bhi kulli ki. iske baad aap ne hamein maghrib ki Namaz padhai aur wuzu nahi kya (maghrib ke liye kyonke pahley se baa-wuzoo they). Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine Yahya se us hadis mein yun suna ke aap ne na sattu khaatey waqt wuzu kya na khaney se farigh ho kar."
"5385","ham Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they, us waqt unka roti pakaaney wala khaadim bhi maujood tha. unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi chapaatii (maida ki rotii) nahi khaaii aur na saari dam-pukhta bakri khaaii yahan tak ke aap Allah se ja miley."
"5386","mein nahi janta ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi tashtarii rakh kar (eik waqt mukhtalif qism ka ( khana khaya ho aur na kabhi aap ne patlii rotiyaan (chapaatiyaan) khaaiin aur na kabhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mez par khaayaa. Qatada se puchha gaya ke phir kis cheez par aap khaatey they? kaha ke aap (aam dastar-khuwaan) par khana khaya kartey they."
"5387","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah ke baad unke sath rastey mein qiyam kya aur maine musalmanon ko aap ke walima ki dawat mein bulaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dastar-khuwaan bichhaaney ka hukm diya aur wo bichhaayaa gaya, phir aap ne is par khajoor, paneer aur ghi daal diya aur Amr bin abi Amr ne kaha, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath sohbat ki, phir aik chamdey ke dastar-khuwaan par (khajoor, ghii, paneer mila kar bana hua) halwa rakha."
"5388","ahale-Shaam (Syria) (Hujjaaj-bin-Yoosuf ke faujii) Sham (Syria) ke log Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko aar dilaane ke liye kehney lagey ''yaa ibn-zaatun-naqaatein''aey 2 kamar band wali ke betey aur unki waalida, Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha, aey betey! ye tumhen 2 kamar band wali ki aar dilaatey hain, tumhen malum hai wo kamar band kya they? wo mera kamar band tha jiske maine 2 tukdey kar diye they aur aik tukdey se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bartan ka munh baandha tha aur doosrey se dastar-khuwaan banaya (is mein khane-pine ka saman lapetaa). Wahab ne bayan kya ke phir jab Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko ahale-Shaam (Syria) 2 kamar band wali ki aar dilaatey they, to wo kehtey haan. Allah ki qasam! ye beshak sach hai aur wo ye misra'a padhtey ( تلك شكاة ظاهر عنك عارها) ye to waisaa ta'na hai jis mein kuchh aib nahi hai."
"5389","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khala umme-Hufaid-binte-Haaris-bin-huzn (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ghii, paneer aur saahina hadiya ke taur par bhejii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurton ko bulaya aur unhon-ne aap ke dastar-khuwaan par saahina ko khaya lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey hath bhi nahi lagaya jaisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey na-pasand kartey hain. lekin agar saahina haram hota to aap ke dastar-khuwaan par khaya na jata aur na aap unhein khaney ke liye farmatey."
"5390","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maqam sahbaa mein they. wo khaibar se aik manzil par hai. Namaz ka waqt qareeb tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khana talab farmaya lekin sattu ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi laai gaee. aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko phaank liya aur ham ne bhi phaankaa phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani talab farmaya aur kulli ki. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhai aur ham ne bhi aap ke sath Namaz padhi aur aap ne (is Namaz ke liye nayaa) wuzu nahi kya."
"5391","mujhey abu-Umaama-bin-Sahal-bin-Haneef Ansari ne khabar di, unhein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di aur unhein Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo saifullaah ( Allah ki talwaar (ke laqab se mashhoor hain, khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar mein dakhil huey. Ummul-Momenin unki aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khala hain. unke yahan bhunaa hua saahina maujood tha jo unki behan Hufaida binte- al-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) Najad se laai thin. unhon-ne wo bhunaa hua saahina Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. aisa bahut kam hota tha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi khaney ke liye us waqt tak hath badhaayein jab tak aapko iske mutaalliq bata na diya jaey ke ye falan khana hai lekin us din aap ne bhuney huey saahiney ke gosht ki taraf hath badhaayaa. itney mein wahan maujood aurton mein se aik aurat ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bata kyon nahi detiin ke us waqt aap ke samney jo tum ne pesh kya hai wo saahina hai, ya Rasulullah! (ye sun kar) aap ne apna hath saahina se hata liya. Khaalid-bin-Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke ya Rasulullah ! kya saahina haram hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi lekin ye mere mulk mein chunkey nahi paya jata, isliye tabeeat pasand nahi karti . Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir maine usey apni taraf kheench liya aur usey khaayaa. us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey dekh rahe they."
"5392","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke 2 aadmiyon ka khana teen ke liye kafi hai aur teen ka char ke liye kafi hai."
"5393","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) us waqt tak khana nahi khaatey they, jab tak unke sath khaney ke liye koi miskeen na laya jata. aik martaba mein unke sath khaney ke liye aik shakhs ko laya ke usne bahut zyada khana khaayaa. baad mein ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke aainda us shakhs ko mere sath khaney ke liye na lana . maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke momin aik aant mein khata aur kaafir saaton aantein bhar leta hai."
"5394","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin aik aant mein khata hai aur kaafir ya munafiq (abda ne kaha ke) mujhey yaqin nahi ke unmein se kis ke mutaalliq Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke wo saaton aantein bhar leta hai aur ibne-Bukair ne bayan kya, unse Imam Malik ne bayan kya, unse Naafe ne, unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi hadis ki tarah bayan farmaayaa."
"5395","Abu-Nuhaik badey khaney waley they. unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke kaafir saaton aanton mein khata hai. Abu-Nuhaik ne is par arz kya ke main Allah aur uske rasool par eman rakhta hun."
"5396","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman aik aant mein khata hai aur kaafir saaton aanton mein khata hai."
"5397","aik sahib bahut zyada khana khaya kartey they, phir wo Islam laey to kam khaney lagey. iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin aik aant mein khata hai aur kaafir saaton aanton mein khata hai."
"5398","maine abu-Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tek laga kar nahi khata ."
"5399","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi se jo aap ke paas maujood they farmaya ke main tek laga kar nahi khata ."
"5400","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye bhunaa hua saahina pesh kya gaya to aap usey khaney ke liye mutwajjeh huey. usi waqt aapko bataya gaya ke ye saahina hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath rok liya. Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha kya ye haram hai? farmaya ke nahi lekin chunkey ye mere mulk mein nahi hota isliye tabeeat usey gawara nahi karti . phir Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey khaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dekh rahe they. Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se ( ضب محنوذ‏ . Mina ( (yani bhunaa hua saahina ( ضب مشوی ( ki jagah ( محنوذ‏) naql kya, donon lafzon ka aik mana hai)."
"5401","Utban bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se they aur qabila Ansar ke un logon mein se they jinhoney badr ki ladai mein shirkat ki thi. aap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! meri nigaah kamzor hai aur main apni qaum ko Namaz padhaataa hun. barsat mein wadi jo mere aur unke darmyan haail hai, bahney lagti hai aur mere liye unki masjid mein jana aur unmein Namaz padhna mumkin nahi rahtaa. isliye ya Rasulullah ! meri ye khahish hai ke aap mere ghar tashrif ley chalein aur mere ghar mein aap Namaz padhein taake main usi jagah ko Namaz padhney ki jagah bana loon. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke inshaAllah mein jald hi aisa karunga . Utban (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath chasht ke waqt jab suraj kuchh buland ho gaya tashrif laey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne andar aaney ki ijazat chaahi. maine aapko ijazat de di. aap baithey nahi balke ghar mein dakhil ho gaey aur malum farmaya ke apne ghar mein kis jagah tum pasand kartey ho ke main Namaz padhun ? maine ghar ke aik koney ki taraf ishara kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan khadey ho gaey aur (namaz ke liye) takbeer kahi . ham ne bhi (aap ke peechhey ( saf bana li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khazeera ( Hurera ki aik qism) ke liye jo aap ke liye ham ne banaya tha rok liya. ghar mein qabeele ke bahut se log aa aa kar jama ho gaey. unmein se aik sahib ne kaha Maalik-bin-dakhshan kahan hain? is par kisi ne kaha ke wo to munafiq hai Allah aur uske rasool se usey mohabbat nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye na kaho, kya tum nahi dekhtey ke unhon-ne iqrar kya hai ke) لا إله إلا الله ( yani Allah ke siwa aur koi maabood nahi aur us se unka maqsad sirf Allah ki khushnoodii hasil karna hai. un sahabi ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool hi zyada jantey hain. rawi ne bayan kya ke ham ne arz kya (ya rasoolullaah!) lekin ham unki tawajjoh aur unka lagaao munaafeqeen ke sath hi dekhtey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : lekin Allah ne dozakh ki aag ko us shakhs par haram kar diya hai jisne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله (ka iqrar kar liya ho aur us se iska maqsad Allah ki khushnoodii ho. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke phir maine Husain bin-Muhammad Ansari se jo bani Salim ke aik fard aur unke sardaar they. Mehmood ki hadis ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne uski tasdeeq ki."
"5402","meri khala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein saahina ka gosht, paneer aur doodh hadiyatan pesh kya to saahina ka gosht aap ke dastar-khuwaan par rakha gaya aur agar saahina haram hota to aap ke dastar-khuwaan par nahi rakha ja sakta tha lekin aap ne doodh piyaa aur paneer khaayaa."
"5403","hamein Juma ke din badi khushi rehti thi. hamari aik boodhi khatun thin wo chuqandar ki jadein lekar apni handi mein pakaatii thin, uper se kuchh daney jau ke usmein daal deti thin. ham Juma ki Namaz padh kar unki mulaqat ko jatey to wo hamarey samney ye khana rakhti thin. Juma ke din hamein badi khushi isi wjah se rehti thi. ham Namaz Juma ke baad hi khana khaya kartey they. Allah ki qasam! na usmein charbi hoti thi na ghi aur jab bhi ham mazey se usko khaatey."
"5404","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shaaney ki haddi ka gosht khaayaa, phir khadey huey aur Namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (namaz ke liye nayaa) wuzu nahi kya aur (usi sanad se) ."
"5405","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paktii hui handiya mein se adh kachchi buti nikaalii aur usey khaya phir Namaz padhai aur nayaa wuzu nahi kya."
"5406","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Makka ki taraf nikley (Suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par) dusri sanad ( hadis dekhein 5407 ("
"5407","mein aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand sahaba ke sath Makka ke raaste mein aik manzil par betha hua tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey aagey padao kya tha. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ehram ki haalat mein they lekin main ehram mein nahi tha. logon ne aik gorkhar ko dekha. mein us waqt apna jootaa taankney mein masroof tha. un logon ne mujhey us gorkhar ke mutaalliq bataya kuchh nahi lekin chahtey they ke main kisi tarah dekh loon. chunanche main mutwajjeh hua aur maine usey dekh liya, phir main ghodey ke paas gaya aur usey zeen pehna kar is par Sawar ho gaya lekin kodaa aur neza bhool gaya tha. maine un logon se kaha ke kodaa aur neza mujhey de do. unhon-ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qism ! ham tumhari shikar ke maamle mein koi madad nahi karengey. (kyonke ham ehram ki haalat mein hain) main ghussa ho gaya aur maine utar kar khud ye donon cheezein uthaaiin phir Sawar ho kar is par hamla kya aur zabah kar liya. jab wo thanda ho gaya to main usey sath laya phir pakka kar maine aur sab ne khaya lekin baad mein unhein shuba hua ke ehram ki haalat mein us ( shikar ka gosht ( khana kaisa hai? phir ham rawaana huey aur maine iska gosht chipa kar rakha. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey to ham ne aap se iske mutaalliq poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, tumharey paas kuchh bacha hua bhi hai? maine wahi dast pesh kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi usey khaayaa. yahan tak ke iska gosht aap ne apne daanton se kheench kheench kar khaya aur aap ehram mein they Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne bayan kya ke mujh se Zaid-bin-Aslam ne ye waqia bayan kya, unse Ata-bin-Yasar ne aur unse abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah Sara waqia bayan kya."
"5408","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aap apne hath se bakri ke shaaney ka gosht kaat kar kha rahe they, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ke liye bulaya gaya to aap ne gosht aur wo chhuri jis se gosht ki buti kaat rahe they, daal di aur Namaz ke liye khadey ho gaey, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi aur aap ne nayaa wuzu nahi kya (kyonke aap pahley hi wuzu kiye huey they)."
"5409","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi kisi khaney mein koi aib nahi nikaalaa. agar pasand hua to kha liya aur agar na-pasand hua to chhod diya."
"5410","kya tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein maida dekha tha? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi, maine puchha kya tum jau ke aatey ko chhaantey they? kaha nahi, balke ham usey sirf phoonk liya kartey they."
"5411","aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko khajoor taqseem ki aur har shakhs ko saat (7) khajoorein din. mujhey bhi saat (7) khajoorein inayat farmaaiin. unmein aik kharaab thi (aur sakht thi) lekin mujhey wahi sabse zyada achi malum hui kyonke iska chabaanaa mujh ko mushkil ho gaya."
"5412","maine apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath un saat (7) aadmiyon mein se saatwan paya (jinhon ne Islam sabse pahley qabool kya tha) us waqt hamarey paas khaney ke liye yahi keekar ke phal ya patey ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hota. ye khaatey khaatey ham logon ka pakhana bhi bakri ki mengniyon ki tarah ho gaya tha ya ab ye zamana hai ke bani Asad qabeeley ke log mujh ko shariiat ke ehkaam sikhlaatey hain. agar main abhi tak us haal mein hon ke bani Asad ke log mujh ko shariiat ke ehkaam sikhlaayein tab to main tabah hi ho gaya meri mehnat barbad ho gaee."
"5413","maine Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi maida khaya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke jab Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Nabi banaya us waqt se wafat tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maida dekha bhi nahi tha. maine puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein aap ke paas chhalniyaan thin. kaha ke jab Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Nabi banaya us waqt se aap ki wafat tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhalnii dekhi bhi nahi. bayan kya ke maine puchha aap log phir baghair chhanaa hua jau kis tarah khaatey they? batlaya ham usey pees letey they phir usey phoonktey they jo kuchh udnaa hota ud jata aur jo baqi reh jata usey goondh letey (aur pakka kar) kha letey they."
"5414","wo kuchh logon ke paas se guzrey jinke samney bhunii hui bakri rakhi thi. unhon-ne unko khaney par bulaya lekin unhon-ne khaney se inkar kar diya aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is duniya se rukhsat ho gaey aur aap ne kabhi jau ki roti bhi aasooda ho kar nahi khaaii."
"5415","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi mez par khana nahi khaya aur na tashtarii mein 2-4 qism ki cheezein rakh kar khaaiin aur na kabhi chapaatii khaaii. maine Qatada se poochha, phir aap kis cheez par khana khaatey they? batlaya ke Safraa (chamdey ke dastar-khuwaan) par."
"5416","Madina hijrat karne ke baad aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi barabar teen din tak gehun ki roti pet bhar kar nahi khaaii yahan tak ke aap duniya se tashrif ley gaey."
"5417","jab kisi ghar mein kisi ki wafat ho jati aur uski wjah se auratein jama hotiin aur phir wo chali jaatiin . sirf ghar waley aur khas khas auratein reh jaatiin to aap handi mein talbeena pakaaney ka hukm detiin. wo pakaya jata phir sareed banaya jata aur talbeena is par daala jata. phir Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmaatiin ke isey khaao kyonke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke talbeena mareez ke dil ko taskeen deta hai aur uska gham door karta hai."
"5418","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mardon main to bahut se kaamil huey lekin aurton mein Maryam binte- Imran aur firaun ki biwi aasiya ke siwa aur koi kaamil nahi hua aur Aaisha ki fazeelat tamam aurton par aisi hai jaisey tamam khaanon par sareed ki fazeelat hai."
"5419","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aurton par Aaisha ki fazeelat aisi hai jaisey tamam khaanon par sareed ki fazeelat hai."
"5420","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aap ke aik ghulam ke paas gaya jo darzii they. unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aik piyala pesh kya jis mein sareed tha. bayan kya ke phir wo apne kaam mein lag gaey. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usmein se kadu talash karne lagey kaha ke phir main bhi usmein se kadu talash kar karke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney rakhney laga. bayan kya ke iske baad se main bhi kadu bahut pasand karta hun."
"5421","ham Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to unki roti pakaaney wala unke paas hi khada tha. unhon-ne kaha ke khaao. main nahi janta ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi patlii roti (chapaatii) dekhi ho. yahan tak ke aap Allah se ja miley aur na Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi musallam bhunii hui bakri dekhi."
"5422","maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bakri ke shaane mein se gosht kaat rahe they, phir aap ne usmein se khaayaa. phir aapko Namaz ke liye bulaya gaya to aap khadey ho gaey aur chhuri daal di aur Namaz padhi lekin nayaa wuzu nahi kya."
"5423","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen din se zyada qurbani ka gosht khaney se mana kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa kabhi nahi kya. sirf aik saal iska hukm diya tha jis saal qahat padaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaha tha (is hukm ke zariie') ke jo maal waley hain wo (gosht mehfooz karne ke bajaey) mohtajon ko khilaa dein aur ham bakri ke paaey mehfooz rakh letey they aur usey pandarah pandarah din baad khaatey they. unse puchha gaya ke aisa karne ke liye kya majboorii thi? is par Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu) hans padiin aur farmaya aal Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saalan ke sath gehun ki roti teen din tak barabar kabhi nahi khaaii yahan tak ke aap Allah se ja miley aur ibne- Kasir ne bayan kya ke hamein Sufiyan ne khabar di, unse Abdur-Rehman bin Aabis ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5424","(Makka Mukarrama se Haj ki) qurbani ka gosht ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein Madina Munawra latey they. uski mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad ne ki ibne-Uena ke waaste se aur ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya ke maine Ata se puchha kya Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha tha ke yahan tak ke ham Madina Munawra aa gaey? unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne ye nahi kaha tha."
"5425","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke apne yahan ke bachchon mein koi bachcha talash kar lao jo mere kaam kar diya kare. chunanche abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) mujhey apni sawari par apne peechhey bitha kar laey. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki, jab bhi aap kahin padao kartey khidmat karta. main suna karta tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kasrat se ye dua padha kartey they ( اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الهم والحزن , Mina padhi. والعجز والكسل , Mina padhi. والبخل والجبن وضلع الدين , Mina padhi. وغلبة الرجال ) ''aey Allaah! main teri panah mangta hun gham se, ranj se, ajz se, sustii se, kanjoosii se, buzdili se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalba se.'' ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) phir main us waqt se barabar aap ki khidmat karta raha. yahan tak ke ham khaibar se wapas huey aur Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) bhi sath thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein pasand farmaya tha. main dekhta tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye apni sawari par peechhey kapdey se parda kya aur phir unhein wahan bithaya . aakhir jab maqam sahbaa mein pahunchey to aap ne dastar-khuwaan par hees (khajoor, paneer aur ghi wghaira ka maleeda) banaya phir mujhey bheja aur maine logon ko bula laayaa, phir sab logon ne usey khaayaa. yahi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah ki dawat walima thi. phir aap rawaana huey aur jab ahad dikhai diya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye pahaad ham se mohabbat rakhta hai aur ham us se mohabbat rakhtey hain. iske baad jab Madina nazar aaya to farmaya ke aey Allaah! main iske donon pahadon ke darmyani ilaaqey ko isi tarah hurmat wala ilaqa banata hun jis tarah Ibrahim ne Makka ko hurmat wala Shahar banaya tha. aey Allaah! iske rehney walon ko barkat ata farmaa. unke mudd main aur unke saa mein barkat farmaa."
"5426","ye log Huzefa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein maujood they. unhon-ne pani maanga to aik majusi ne unko pani ( chandi ke pyaley mein) la kar diya. jab us ne piyala unke hath mein diya to unhon-ne piyaale ko is par phenk kar maara aur kaha agar maine usey bahut baar us se mana na kya hota (ke chandi soney ke bartan mein mujhey kuchh na diya karo) aagey wo ye farmana chahtey they ke to main us se ye mamla na karta lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke resham w deebaa na pahno aur na soney chandi ke bartan mein kuchh piyo aur na unki pleton mein kuchh khaao kyonke ye cheezein un (kuffaar ke liye) duniya mein hain aur hamarey liye aakhirat mein hain."
"5575","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne duniya mein sharab pi aur phir us ne tauba nahi ki to aakhirat mein wo us se mahroom rahega."
"5576","jis raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meraaj karaai gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) baitul-maqdis ke Shahar ( iiliyaa mein sharab aur doodh ke 2 pyaley pesh kiye gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doodh ka piyala ley liya. is par Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha us Allah ke liye tamam ta'reefein hain jisne aapko Deen fitrat ki taraf chalney ki hidayat farmai . agar aap ne sharab ka piyala ley liya hota to aap ki ummat gumrah ho jati. Shuaib ke sath us hadis ko Mamar , ibnul-haad, Usman bin umr aur Zubaidi ne Zohri se naql kya hai."
"5577","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik hadis suni jo tum se ab mere siwa koi aur nahi bayan karega (kyonke ab mere siwa koi sahabi zinda maujood nahi raha hai). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ki nishaniyon mein se ye hai ke jahaalat ghalib ho jaeygi aur ilm kam ho jaeyga zinaakaarii badh jaeygi, sharab kasarat se pi janey lagegii, auratein bahut ho jaaeingii, yahan tak ke pachaas-pachaas aurton ki nigrani karne wala sirf aik hi mard reh jaeyga"
"5578","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs jab zina karta hai to theek zina kartey waqt wo momin nahi hota. isi tarah jab wo sharab peetaa hai to theek sharab peetey waqt wo momin nahi hota. isi tarah jab chor chori karta hai to us waqt wo momin nahi hota aur ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya, unhein Abdul-Malik -bin-abi-Bakr bin Abdur-Rehman bin Haris-bin-Hisham ne khabar di, unse Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey they aur unse Abu-Hurera (rz). phir unhon-ne bayan kya ke Abu-Bakar bin Abdur-Rehman Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis mein zikr kiye huey maamlon ke sath itna aur zyada kartey they ke koi shakhs (din dahaadey) agar kisi badi poonjii par is tarah daaka daalta hai ke log dekhtey ke dekhtey reh jatey hain to wo momin rahtey huey ye loot-maar nahi karta."
"5579","jab sharab haram ki gaee to angoor ki sharab Madina Munawra mein nahi miltii thi."
"5580","ham se Yunus ne, unse Sabit Bunani ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab sharab ham par haram ki gaee to Madina Munawra mein angoor ki sharab bahut kam miltii thi. aam istemal ki sharab kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5581","ham se Aamir ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) mimber par khadey huey aur kaha ammaa ba'd! jab sharab ki hurmat ka hukm nazil hua to wo panch chizon se bantii thi angoor, khajoor, shahad, gehun aur jau aur sharab (khamr) wo hai jo aql ko mitaa de."
"5582","mein abu-Ubaida, abu-Talha aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ko kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki hui sharab pilaa raha tha ke aik aaney waley ne aa kar bataya ke sharab haram kar di gaee hai. us waqt abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Anas utho aur sharab ko baha do chunanche maine usey baha diya."
"5583","aik qabeele mein khada main apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharab pilaa raha tha main unmein sabse kam Umr tha. kisi ne kaha ke sharab haram kar di gaee. un hazraat ne kaha ke ab usey phenk do. chunanche ham ne sharab phenk di. maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke wo kis cheez ki sharab bantii thi? farmaya ke taaza pakkii hui aur kachchi khajooron ki. Abu-Bakar bin Anas ne kaha ke unki sharab ( khajoor ki) hoti thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska inkar nahi kya aur mujh se mere kuchh ashaab ne bayan kya ke unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke us zamane mein unki sharab aksar kachchi aur pakkii khajoor se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5584","mujh se Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab sharab haram ki gaee to wo kachchi aur pukhta khajooron se taiyaar ki jati thi."
"5585","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (bitaa') ke mutaalliq puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo bhi peeney wali cheez nasha laavey wo haram hai."
"5586","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( bitaa' (ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya. ye mashroob shehad se taiyaar kya jata tha aur Yaman mein iska aam riwaaj tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo cheez bhi nasha laney wali ho wo haram hai."
"5587","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ''dabbaa''aur ''muzaffat'' mein nabeez na banaya karo aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) iske sath '' hantam ''aur '' naqeer '' ka bhi izafa kya kartey they."
"5588","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke member par khutba detey huey kaha jab sharab ki hurmat ka hukm hua to wo panch chizon se bantii thi. angoor se, khajoor se, gehun se, jau aur shehad se aur (khamr) wo hai jo aql nasha taarii kar de aur teen masayel aisey hain ke meri tamanna thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se juda honey se pahley hamein unka hukm bata jatey, dada ka mas'ala, kalaala ka masla aur sood ke chand masaayel. abu-Hayyan ne bayan kya ke maine Shabi se puchha : aey abu-Amr ! aik aisa sharbat hai jo sindh mein chaawal se banaya jata hai. unhon-ne kaha ke ye cheez Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein nahi paai jati thi ya kaha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamaney mein na thi aur farj ibne-minhaal ne bhi is hadis ko Hammaad-bin-Salma se bayan kya aur unse abu-Hayyan ne usmein angoor ke bajaey kishmish hai."
"5589","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke sharab panch chizon se bantii thi kishmish , khajoor , geihun, jau aur shehad se."
"5590","mujh se abu-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ya abu-Malik Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya : Allah ki qism ! unhon-ne jhoot nahi bayan kya ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein aisey burey log paida ho jaeinge jo zinaakaarii karenge, resham pehna karenge, sharab piyaa karenge aur gaaney bajaey ko halal bana lengey aur kuchh mutakabbir qism ke log pahaad ki choti par (apne banglon mein rihaaish karne ke liye) chaley jaengey. charwaahey unke maweshii subah w Sham laaengey aur ley jaengey. unke paas aik faqeer aadmi apni zarurat lekar jaeyga to wo taalney ke liye us se kahengey ke kal aana lekin Allah Taala raat ko unko (unki sarkashi ki wjah se) halaak kar dega pahaad ko (un par) gira dega aur unmein se bahut son ko qiyamat tak ke liye bandar aur Sura ki Suraton mein maskh kar dega."
"5591","abu-Usaid Malik bin Rabe aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne waleeme ki dawat di, unki biwi hi sab kaam kar rahi thin halanke wo nai dulhan thin. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya tumhen malum hai ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya pilaya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye unhon-ne patthar ke koondey mein raat ke waqt khajoor bhigo di thi."
"5592","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney ki (jin mein sharab bantii thi) manaahii kar di thi phir Ansar ne arz kya ke hamarey paas to doosrey bartan nahi hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to khair phir ijazat hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) kehtey hain mujh se khaleefa bin khayyaat ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sufiyan Sory ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor bin Motamir ne aur unse Saalim-bin abi-Jad ne phir yahi hadis riwayat ki thi."
"5593","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkon ke siwa aur bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaya to logon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! har kisi ko mashk kahan se mil sakti hai? us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bin laakh lagey ghadey ( raughane-zuft lagey bartan ( mein nabeez bhigoney ki ijazat de di. ham se Abdullah-bin Muhammad masnadii ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sufiyan Sory ne yahi bayan kya aur is mein yun hai ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand bartanon mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaayaa."
"5594","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dabbaa aur muzaffat ( khas qism ke bartan jin mein sharab bantii thi) ke istemal ki bhi manaahii kar di thi. ham se Usman ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Jarir ne bayan kya, kaha unse Aamash ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5595","maine Aswad bin Yazeed se puchha kya tum ne Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha tha ke kis bartan mein nabeez (khajoor ka meethaa sharbat) banaanaa makruh hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan, maine arz kya ummul-momeneen! kis bartan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nabeez banaaney se mana farmaya tha. unhon-ne kaha ke khas ghar walon ko kadu ki tonbii aur laakhii bartan mein nabeez bhigoney se mana farmaya tha. (Ibraaheem Nakhai ne bayan kya ke) maine Aswad se puchha unhon-ne ghadey aur sabz martban ka zikr nahi kya. usne kaha ke main tum se wahi bayan karta hun jo maine suna, kya wo bhi bayan kar dun jo maine na suna ho?"
"5596","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sabz ghadey se mana farmaya tha, maine puchha kya ham safaid ghadon mein pi liya karein kaha ke nahi."
"5597","abu-Usaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne waleeme ki dawat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di, us din unki biwi (umme-Usaid Sulaamaa) hi mahmaanon ki khidmat kar rahi thin. bevi abu-Usaid ne kaha tum jantey ho maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye kis cheez ka sharbat taiyaar kya tha patthar ke koondey mein raat ke waqt kuchh khajoorein bhigo di thin aur doosrey din subah ko aapko pilaa di thi."
"5598","maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se ( باذق ( ) angoor ka sheera halki aanch diya hua) ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( باذق (ke wujood se pahley hi duniya se rukhsat ho gaey they jo cheez bhi nasha laey wo haram hai. abul-Juweriya ne kaha ke) باذق ( to halal w paak hai. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke angoor halal w paak tha jab uski sharab bin gaee to wo haram khabees hai (na ke halal w paak) ."
"5599","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) halwaa aur shehad ko dost rakhtey they."
"5600","maine abu-Talha, abu-Dujaana aur Suhel bin baizaa (Raziallahu anhu) ko kachchi khajoor ki mili hui nabeez pilaa raha tha ke sharab haram kar di gaee aur maine maujooda sharab phenk di. main hi unhein pilaa raha tha main sabse kam Umr tha. ham us nabeez ko us waqt sharab hi samajhtey they aur Amr-bin-Haris rawi ne bayan kya ke ham se Qatada ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"5601","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kishmish aur khajoor (ke sheere) ko aur taaza (pukhta, pakkii hui) khajoor aur neem pukhta (kachchii, gadrii hui) khajoor ko mila kar bhigoney se mana farmaya tha, us taur usmein nasha jaldi paida ho jata hai."
"5602","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski manaahii ki thi ke pukhta aur gadraaii hui khajoor, pukhta khajoor aur kishmish ko mila kar nabeez banaya jaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har aik ko juda judaa bhigoney ka hukm diya."
"5603","shabe-mea'raaj mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko doodh aur sharab ke 2 pyaley pesh kiye gaey."
"5604","Arfa ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke roza ke barey mein sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ko shuba tha. isliye maine aap ke liye aik bartan mein doodh bheja aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pi liya. Humaidii kehtey hain kabhi Sufiyan is hadis ko yun bayan kartey they ke Arfa ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke roze ke barey mein logon ko shuba tha isliye umme-fazal ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye (doodh) bhejaa. kabhi Sufiyan us hadis ko mursalan Umme- Fazal se riwayat kartey they, Salim aur Umer ka naam na letey. jab unse poochhtey ke ye hadis mursal hai ya marfooan muttasil to wo us waqt kehtey (marfooa muttasil hai) umme-Fazal se marwi (bayan) hai (jo sahaabiya thiin)."
"5605","abu Humaid Saaidi maqam naqeea' se doodh ka aik piyala (khulaa hua) laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey dhak kar kyon nahi laey aik lakdi hi is par rakh letey."
"5606","unhon-ne bayan kya ke aik Ansari sahabi abu Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) maqam naqeea' se aik bartan mein doodh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye laey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey dhak kar kyon nahi laaey, is par lakdi hi rakh detey aur Aamash ne kaha ke mujh se Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya, unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5607","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka Mukarrama se tashrif laey to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke sath they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke (raaste mein) ham aik charwaahey ke qareeb se guzrey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) piyaasey they phir maine aik pyaley main (charwaahey se poochh kar) kuchh doodh dohaa. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo doodh piyaa aur us se mujhey khushi hasil hui aur suraaqa-bin-Ja'sham ghodey par Sawar hamarey paas ( ta'aqub kartey huey) pahunch gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske liye baddua ki. aakhir usne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske haq mein baddua na karein aur wo wapas ho jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa hi kya."
"5608","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya hi umda sadqa hai khub doodh dene wali ontni jo kuchh dinon ke liye kisi ko Atiya ke taur par di gaee ho aur khub doodh dene wali bakri jo kuchh dinon ke liye Atiya ke taur par di gaee ho jis se subah w Sham doodh bartan bhar-bhar kar nikala jaey."
"5609","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne doodh piyaa phir kulli ki aur farmaya ke ismein chiknaahat hoti hai."
"5610","unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab mujhey Sidratul-Muntahaa tak ley jaya gaya to wahan maine char nehrein dekhein . 2 zahiri nehrein aur 2 baatinii . zahiri nehrein to neel aur Furaat hain aur baatinii nehrein jannat ki 2 nehrein hain. phir mere paas teen pyaley laey gaey aik pyaley mein doodh tha, doosrey mein shehad tha aur teesrey mein sharab thi. maine wo piyala liya jis mein doodh tha aur piyaa . is par mujh se kaha gaya ke tum ne aur tumhari ummat ne asl fitrat ko pa liya. Hisham , Saeed aur Hammam ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Malik bin Sasa (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis riwayat ki hai. usmein nadiyon ka zikr to aisa hi hai lekin teen piyaalon ka zikr nahi hai."
"5611","abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas Madina ke tamam Ansar mein sabse zyada khajoor ke baghaat they aur unka sabse pasandida maal beerhaa ka baagh tha. ye masjide-Nabawi ke samney hi tha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan tashrif ley jatey they aur uska umda pani peetey they. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir jab aayat لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ''tum hargiz neki nahi paogey jab tak wo maal na kharch karo jo tumhen azeez ho.'' nazil hui to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah Taala farmata hai لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ''tum hargiz neki ko nahi paogey jab tak wo maal na kharch karo jo tumhen azeez ho.'' aur mujhey apne maal mein sabse zyada azeez beerhaa ka baagh hai aur wo Allah Taala ke raaste mein sadqa hai, iska sawab aur ajr main Allah ke yahan paaney ki ummeed rakhta hon, isliye ya Rasulullah ! aap jahan usey munasib khayal farmaein kharch karein. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khub ye bahut hi fayda bakhsh maal hai ya (iske bajaey aap ne) ( رايح ( ) ya ke sath farmaya ( . rawi hadis Abdullah ko usmein shak tha (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse mazeed farmaya ke) jo kuchh tu ney kaha hai maine sun liya mera khayal hai ke tum usey apne rishte-daaron ko de do. abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke aisa hi karunga ya Rasulullah! chunanche unhon-ne apne rishte daaron apne chacha ke ladkon mein usey taqseem kar diya aur Ismail aur Yahya-bin-Yahya ne ( رايح‏ (ka lafz naql kya hai."
"5612","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko doodh peetey dekha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke ghar tashrif laey they (bayaan kya ke) maine bakri ka doodh nikala aur is mein kuwein ka taaza pani mila kar (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) pesh kya aap ne piyala lekar piyaa . aap ke baain taraf Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) they aur daain taraf aik dehati tha aap ne apna baqi doodh dehati ko diya aur farmaya ke pahley daain taraf se, haan daain taraf waley ka haq hai."
"5613","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi ke yahan tashrif le gaey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aap ke aik rafeeq (abu-Bakar (rz)) bhi they. unse Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumharey yahan usi raat ka baasii pani kisi mishkeezey mein rakha hua ho (to hamein pulaao) warna munh laga ke pani pi lengey. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke wo sahib (jinke yahan aap tashrif liye gaey they) apne baagh mein pani de rahe they. bayan kya ke un sahib ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! mere paas raat ka baasii pani maujood hai, aap chhappar mein tashrif ley chalein. bayan kya ke phir wo un donon hazraat ko sath lekar gaey phir unhon-ne aik piyaale mein pani liya aur apni aik doodh dene wali bakri ka usmein doodh nikaalaa. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa, iske baad aap ke rafeeq Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne piyaa."
"5614","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sheerinii aur shehad ko dost rakhtey they."
"5615","wo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein masjid Kufa ke sehan mein hazir huey phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne khadey ho kar piyaa aur kaha ke kuchh log khadey ho kar pani peeney ko makruh samajhtey hain halanke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah kartey dekha hai jis tarah tum ne mujhey is waqt khadey ho kar pani peetey dekha hai."
"5616","unhon-ne Zohar ki Namaz padhi phir Kufa ki masjid ke sehan mein logon ki zarooraton ke liye baith gaey. us arse mein Asr ki Namaz ka waqt aa gaya phir unke paas pani laya gaya. unhon-ne pani piyaa aur apna chehra aur hath dhoey, unke sar aur paon (ke dhoney ka bhi) zikr kya. phir unhon-ne khadey ho kar wuzu ka bacha hua pani piyaa, iske baad kaha ke kuchh log khadey ho kar pani peeney ko bura samajhtey hain halanke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yoonhii kya tha jis tarah maine kya, wuzu ka pani khadey ho kar piyaa."
"5617","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamzam ka pani khadey ho kar piyaa."
"5618","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye doodh ka aik piyala bheja maidan Arafaat mein. wo Arfa ke din ki Sham (Syria) ka waqt tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apni sawari par) sawar they, aap ne apne hath mein wo piyala liya aur usey pi liya. Malik ne abu-Nazar se '' apne oont par '' ke alfaz zyada kiye."
"5619","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pani mila hua doodh pesh kya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dahini taraf aik dehati tha aur baain taraf Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pi kar baqi dehati ko diya aur farmaya ke daain taraf se, to daain taraf se."
"5620","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik sharbat laya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se piyaa , aap ke daain taraf aik ladka betha hua tha aur baain taraf boodhey log ( Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) jaisey baithey huey) they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachchey se kaha kya tum mujhey ijazat doge ke main un (boodhey logon) ko (pahley) de dun. ladkey ne kaha : Allah ki qasam, ya Rasulullah ! aap ke jhootey mein se milney waley apne hisse ke maamle mein, main kisi par eisaar nahi karunga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ladkey ke hath mein piyala de diya."
"5621","ham se Yahya bin Saleh ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne bayan kya, unse Saeed bin-Haaris ne aur unse Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi ke yahan tashrif ley gaey. aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aap ke aik rafeeq ne unhein salam kya aur unhoney salam ka jawab diya. phir arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! mere maan-baap aap par nisaar hun ye badi garmi ka waqt hai wo apney baagh mein pani dey rahey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya agar tumharey paas mashk mein raat ka rakha hua pani hai (to wo pilaa do) warna ham munh laga kar pi lengey. wo sahib is waqt bhii baagh mein pani dey rahey they. unhoney arz kya ya Rasulullah! mere paas mashk mein raat ka rakha hua baasii pani hai phir wo chheid (jhaunpdii) mein gaey aur aik pyaley mein baasii pani pi liya phir apni aik doodh dene wali bakri ka doodh is mein nikaalaa. aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa phir wo dobara laey aur is martaba aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rafeeq Hazrat siddeeqe-akbar (Raziallahu anhu) ne piyaa."
"5622","main khada hua apne qabeele mein apne chachaon ko khajoor ki sharab pilaa raha tha. main unmein se sabse chhota tha, itney mein kisi ne kaha ke sharab haram kar di gaee ( abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha ke sharab phenk do. chunanche ham ne phenk di. Sulaiman ne kaha ke maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha us waqt log kis cheez ki sharab peetey they kaha ke pakkii aur kachchi khajoor ki Abu-Bakar bin Anas ne kaha ke yahi unki sharab hoti thi Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska inkar nahi kya, bakr-bin-abdullaah Muzni ya Qatada ne kaha aur mujh se kuchh logon ne bayan kya ke unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke '' unki un dinon yahi ( فضیح ( unki sharab thi. ''"
"5623","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raat ki jab shuruaat ho ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( jab Sham ho to apne bachchon ko rok lo (aur ghar se bahar na nikalney do) kyonke us waqt shaitan phail jatey hain phir jab raat ki aik ghadi guzar jaey to unhein chhod do aur darwazey band kar lo aur us waqt Allah ka naam lo kyonke shaitan band darwazey ko nahi kholtaa aur Allah ka naam lekar apne mishkezon ka munh baandh do. Allah ka naam lekar apne bartanon ko dhak do, chahe kisi cheez ko chaudai mein rakh kar hi dhak sako aur apne charagh (soney se pahley) bujhaa diya karo."
"5624","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum jab soney lago to charagh bujhaa do. darwazey band kar do, mashkon ke munh baandh do aur khaney peeney ke bartanon ko dhanp do. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye bhi kaha chahe lakdi hi ke zariey se dhak sako jo uski chaudai mein bismillaah keh kar rakh di jaey."
"5625","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkon mein (ikhtinaas) se mana farmaya. mashk ka munh khol kar usmein munh laga kar pani peeney se rokaa."
"5626","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke aap ne mashkon main (ikhtinaas) se mana farmaya hai. Abdullah ne bayan kya ke Mamar ne bayan kya ya unke ghair ne ke (ikhtinaas) mashk se munh laga kar pani peeney ko kehtey hain."
"5627","ham se Ikrima ne kaha, tumhen mein chand chhoti chhotii baatein na bata dun jinhein ham se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se munh laga kar pani peeney ki manaahii ki thi aur (is se bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya tha ke) koi shakhs apne padaus ko apni diwar mein khoontii wghaira gaadney se rokey."
"5628","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se pani peeney ki manaahii farma di thi."
"5629","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashk ke munh se pani peeney ko mana farmaya tha."
"5630","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs pani piey to (peeney ke) bartan main (paanii peetey huey) saans na ley aur jab tum mein se koi shakhs peshab karey to daahiney hath ko zakar (private part) par na pherey aur jab istinja karey to daahiney hath se na kare."
"5631","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) 2 ya teen saanson mein pani peetey they."
"5632","Huzefa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) madaain mein they. unhon-ne pani maanga to aik dehati ne unko chandi ke bartan mein pani la kar diya, unhon-ne bartan ko is par phenk maara phir kaha maine bartan sirf is wjah se phainkaa hai ke us shakhs ko main us se mana kar chuka tha lekin ye baaz na aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham w deebaa ke pahnney se aur soney aur chandi ke bartan mein khaney peeney se mana kya tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya tha ke ye cheezein un kuffaar ke liye duniya mein hain aur tumhen aakhirat mein milengey."
"5633","ham Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath nikley phir unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke soney aur chandi ke piyaale mein na piyaa karo aur na resham w deebaa pehna karo kyonke ye cheezein unke liye duniya mein hain aur tumharey liye aakhirat mein hain."
"5634","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs chandi ke bartan mein koi cheez peetaa hai to wo shakhs apne pet mein dozakh ki aag bhadkaa raha hai."
"5635","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) chizon ka hukm diya tha aur saat (7) chizon se ham ko mana farmaya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein bimar ki iyaadat karne, janazey ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ke jawab main ( يرحمك الله ( kahney, dawat karne waley ki dawat ko qabool karne, salam phailaaney, mazloom ki madad karne aur qism khaney ke baad kaffara ada karne ka hukm farmaya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney ki angoothiyon se, chandi mein peeney ya (farmaayaa) chandi ke bartan mein peeney se, میثر (zeen ya kajaawa ke uper resham ka gaddaa (ke istemal karne se aur qassi (misr ke aas-paas taiyaar kya janey wala aik kapda jis mein resham ke dhaagey bhi istemal hotey they) ke istemal karne se aur resham w deebaa aur istibraq pahnney se mana farmaya tha."
"5636","logon ne Arfa ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rozey ke mutaalliq shuba kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein doodh ka aik katora pesh kya gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey nosh farmaayaa."
"5637","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik Arab aurat ka zikr kya gaya phir aap ne Usaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ko unke paas unhein laney ke liye kisi ko bhejney ka hukm diya chunanche unhon-ne bheja aur wo aaiin aur banii-Saaida ke qile mein utriin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi tashrif laey aur unke paas gaey. aap ne dekha ke aik aurat sar jhukaaey baithi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab unse guftgu ki to wo kehney lagiin ke main tum se Allah ki panah maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke maine tujh ko panah dii! logon ne baad mein unse poochha. tumhen malum bhi hai ye kon they. us aurat ne jawab diya ke nahi. logon ne kaha ke ye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) they tum se nikah ke liye tashrif laey they. is par wo boliin ke phir to main badi bad-bakht hun (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko naraz karke wapas kar diyaa) isi din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur Saqeefa bani saaida main apne sahabi ke sath baithey phir farmaya ke Sahal! pani pulaao. maine unke liye ye piyala nikala aur unhein usmein pani pilaayaa. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey liye bhi wahi piyala nikal kar laey aur ham ne bhi usmein pani piyaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir baad mein khaleefa Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne unse ye maang liya tha aur unhon-ne ye unko hiba kar diya tha."
"5638","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka piyala Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas dekha hai wo phat gaya tha to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey chandi se jod diya. phir Aasim ne bayan kya ke wo umda chaudaa piyala hai. chamakdaar lakdi ka bana hua. bayan kya ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke maine us piyaale se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bahut baar pilaya hai. rawi ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Sirin ne kaha ke us piyaale mein lohey ka aik halqa tha. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne chaha ke uski jagah chandi ya soney ka halqa judwaa dein lekin abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha ke jisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banaya hai is mein hargiz koi tabdili na karo chunanche unhon-ne ye irada chhod diya."
"5639","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha aur Asr ki Namaz ka waqt ho gaya thodey se bachey huey pani ke siwa hamarey paas aur koi pani nahi tha usey aik bartan mein rakh kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein apna hath daala aur apni ungliyan phaila diin phir farmaya aao wuzu kar lo ye Allah ki taraf se barkat hai. maine dekha ke pani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ke darmyan se phoot-phoot kar nikal raha tha chunanche sab logon ne us se wuzu kya aur piyaa bhii. maine uski parwah kiye baghair ke pet mein kitna pani ja raha hai khub pani piyaa kyonke mujhey malum ho gaya tha ke barkat ka pani hai. maine Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha aap log us waqt kitni tadaad mein they? batlaya ke aik hazaar char so. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Amr ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ki hai aur Husain aur Amr-bin-Murra ne Salim se bayan kya aur unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke sahaba ki us waqt tadaad pandarah so thi. uski mutabiat (pairavi) Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ki hai."